Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: seed the nine comm helpers communication_club.c calls
 (link fix after 0264)

Patch 0264 seeds the comm club helpers, whose translated code references overlay 3's communication_club.c. That object
is now linked and calls nine functions that exist only as assembly and were neither seeded nor trapped:
sub_0203511C, sub_02035150, sub_02035184, sub_02035198, sub_020351DC (unk_02034B0C.s), sub_0203775C (unk_02035900.s),
sub_02037EC0 (unk_02037C94.s), sub_02058164, sub_02058180 (unk_02058034.s). The link stopped with undefined references.
Seed them so the translator emits them.
